The BERT routing decision rule in router.py follows the Apache-2.0 implementation
of lm-sys/RouteLLM (BERTRouter in routellm/routers/routers.py).
https://github.com/lm-sys/RouteLLM

The original checkpoint is routellm/bert_gpt4_augmented at Hugging Face revision
86237e3df400762178ea98379477b8296e66d5e4, whose supplied LICENSE is Apache-2.0.
Weights are downloaded separately and are not distributed in this repository.

The adapter loads that checkpoint directly, disables dropout using model.eval(),
performs the published softmax decision calculation, and records local runtime.
It does not train a new router or claim calibration to the study's model pair.
